{"2746680": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "DARKWATCH", "steam_appid": 2746680, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Darkwatch is a first-person shooter set in the Lovecraftian mythos. You play as a Darkwatch agent fighting to stop Cthulhu’s invasion with your canine companion by your side. His portals have appeared across Innsmouth, spilling out twisted creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2746680/extras/b1f1a994f5aac9646a7aaf84f8ee8854.avif?t=1761409545\" width=1022 height=256 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You’re not alone!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your loyal dog companion fights by your side — command them to take down enemies, create openings in combat, and upgrade their abilities to make them an even deadlier ally.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2746680/extras/186d1eacd973418c4e285b0c0645f739.avif?t=1761409545\" width=1022 height=256 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade &amp; Become Stronger</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn sanity from every kill to upgrade your perks and weapons. Find Darkwatch crates to expand and customize your arsenal with new weapons and attachments</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2746680/extras/bbba8e5a4f1721f67045e109c2eda4ca.avif?t=1761409545\" width=1024 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Darkwatch is a first-person shooter set in the Lovecraftian mythos. You play as a Darkwatch agent fighting to stop Cthulhu’s invasion with 